@baseUrl = http://localhost:5005
@apiKey = YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

### Get API Health (Liveness Probe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get API Readiness (Readiness Probe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Get Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Get Address API Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/info

### Search for addresses by postcode (Westminster, London)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/search?postcode=SW1A1AA

### Search for addresses with spaced postcode
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/search?postcode=SW1A%201AA

### Search for addresses by postcode (Buckingham Palace area)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/search?postcode=SW1A2AA

### Search for addresses by postcode (Tower of London)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/search?postcode=EC3N4AB

### Test with invalid postcode (empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/search?postcode=

### Test with postcodelike format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/search?postcode=M11AA
